        "    \\caption{An overview of Reasoning via Planning (RAP). Compared with previous LLM reasoning methods like Chain-of-Thought \\cite{wei2022chain}, we explicitly model the world state from a world model (repurposed from the language model), and leverage advanced planning algorithms to solve the reasoning problems.\n",
