            "We evaluate our framework on GSM8k, a dataset of grade school math word problems. We also evaluate the base model with CoT prompting \\cite{wei2022chain}, Least-to-Most prompting \\cite{zhou2022least}, and their self-consistency \\cite{wang2022self} variants, as the baselines. \n",
